@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@token = paste-accessToken-from-login-response

### Complete public endpoint: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public

### Protected endpoint without token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me

### Student login task: 200 with tokenType, accessToken, expiresIn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student","password":"learn-jwt"}

### Wrong password: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student","password":"wrong"}

### Paste accessToken from login above into @token, then expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student token has USER role, so expect 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Login as admin / learn-admin, paste its token, then expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
